Package: reviewkit
Title: Shared Data Snapshot and Readiness Gate for Semi-Annual Resident Review
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
    person("Fred", "Buckhold", , "fbuckhold3@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: One snapshot of a resident's review-window data (duty hours,
    conference attendance, MKSAP, peer reviews, faculty assessments, ITE),
    built once when the self-evaluation is submitted and read by every later
    step of the review (coach, second reviewer, CCC), so each step sees the
    same numbers. Also the data-readiness gate the self-evaluation enforces
    before submission, and JSON storage for the frozen snapshot. Built on
    amiontools (schedule, duty hours, attendance) and gmed (RDM loading).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
